  "effectiveDate": "2019-09-30",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 402) #8955, eff 7-26-07; ss by #11036, eff 3-1-16 (from Env-Wq 402.23); ss by #12553, eff 9-1-18; amd by #12836, eff 9-30-19",
